    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                "word": "hairiness",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "97c6dd99-86eb-45cb-a1b9-572dfb0e37bd",
                        "entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hairinesses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                        "entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The characteristic of being hairy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "172d5820-4cab-43e1-8091-9ff1a72c5933",
                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                "text": "1665, Robert Hooke, Micrographia, Observ. XXVI,\nWe have had (says he) another of this kind brought us out of the East-Indies, which being planted was in shew like the former, but came not to perfection, the unkindly season not suffering it to shew the flower; but of the Cods that were brought, some were smaller, shorter, and rounder then the Garden kind; others much longer, and many growing together, as it were in clusters, and cover'd all over with a brown short hairiness, so fine, that if any of it be rubb'd, or fall on the back of ones hand, or other tender parts of the skin, it will cause a kind of itching […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3e89d4f-8e32-4eb1-a1c6-b0a1d3c08e14",
                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                "text": "The fore-feet of the Yahoo differed from my hands in nothing else but the length of the nails, the coarseness and brownness of the palms, and the hairiness on the backs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c56559a9-42fc-4fa6-902f-c91e64b1bf2e",
                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                "text": "Spanberg, the Russian navigator, landed, he says, in a great island from 43° to 50° lat., speaks of the uncommon hairiness of the natives, and of their wearing of silver in their ears."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0e06b8b-4a64-4a5d-881c-87c5cc3cc763",
                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                "text": "Small reddened but said stubbornly, “The cow likes my singing.” ¶ Cows are different from humans; perhaps the hairiness of their ears strains sound."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56f8ca29-d2e0-3052-90b5-948085769227",
                        "entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A characteristic of yarn: the proportion of fibre ends that stick out and are not embedded in the yarn body."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6379342c-6dbe-4cf6-859c-72f3480f72b6",
                                "sense_id": "56f8ca29-d2e0-3052-90b5-948085769227",
                                "text": "There was a reduction in hairiness of yarn after warping by about 17% in comparison to the hairiness of the wound yarn."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6e3b7ca2-a84e-451d-b4ab-bd7cb51f3c82",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                        "source_sense_description": "the characteristic of being hairy",
                        "target_lang_word": "srstnatost",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac80b833-6594-4ca5-893b-e4e47e59a02e",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                        "source_sense_description": "the characteristic of being hairy",
                        "target_lang_word": "pilosité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pilosité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91cbe06e-c135-3334-82b3-fa9d96c49a37",
                                        "entry_id": "93dbcfcf-9f11-3a98-a2eb-52e9cc02db75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Présence de poil ; aspect pileux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce2139e-6658-4cba-9629-6cc065d4cb91",
                                                "sense_id": "91cbe06e-c135-3334-82b3-fa9d96c49a37",
                                                "text": "L’hirsutisme est le développement excessif de la pilosité chez la femme dans les territoires androgéno-dépendants qui en sont habituellement dépourvus : visage, thorax, ligne blanche, région fessière et intergénitocrurale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ffdc36eb-786b-4962-bc9c-9dfde4ef6ad3",
                                                "sense_id": "91cbe06e-c135-3334-82b3-fa9d96c49a37",
                                                "text": "D'autres analyses ont révélé des variations génétiques associées à la vie dans l'Arctique, comme la pilosité, la thermorégulation ou les dépôts de graisse, suggérant que les mammouths étaient poilus bien avant l'apparition de leur congénère laineux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94f439f5-5a95-3651-bedb-db61e82d1202",
                                        "entry_id": "93dbcfcf-9f11-3a98-a2eb-52e9cc02db75",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ensemble des poils sur un endroit du corps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57db9317-4067-4bbe-a61b-56ca2a77ae5f",
                                                "sense_id": "94f439f5-5a95-3651-bedb-db61e82d1202",
                                                "text": "La main que je vis alors, sans méprise possible, dans la lumière blafarde d’un matin de plein Londres, cette main reposant à demi fermée sur les draps du lit, était au contraire maigre, noueuse, à veines saillantes, d’une pâleur terreuse et revêtue d’une épaisse pilosité."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
